      "type": "/type/text",
      "value": "\"Previously published as a Gotham Books hardcover edition\"--Title page verso.\n\n\"Founding partner of Kleiner Perkins Caufield & Byers\"--Cover.\n\nIncludes index."
    },
    "description": {
      "type": "/type/text",
      "value": "\"Known for his idiosyncratic ideas and golden touch, Tom Perkins has always been one of the business world's most intriguing figures. But his legacy took an unexpected new turn when he resigned from Hewlett-Packard's board in 2006, protesting their chairman's now infamous leak investigation. Perkins recalls these and other fascinating episodes of his life, both personal and professional, including his involvement in the creation of American industries no one could have dreamed of a century ago\"--Publisher description."
    },
